ne-player.\n- Shared damage/pickup/pass/revive/extraction, live-menu neutralization, tuning replication, stale epochs, nonhost departure and end teardown passed. An ownerless server completed the normal expedition.\n- Seven original static shapes rendered with the native asset-sheet tool, zero engine problems. Current title/selection/map/families/dragon/Dev/credits/touch/victory captures inspected.\n- 25 deduplicated game findings repaired, including two critical findings. Fixture/tool mistakes excluded; see docs/issues.json.\n- Biome and Ruff passed. Vendor checksums and interview validated; delivery checksum matches current passing evidence.\n\n## Evidence and limits\n\n- docs/final-acceptance.json, docs/research.md, docs/dependencies.json, docs/content-schema.md, docs/content-manifest.json, docs/evidence.md.\n- evidence/all-latest.json, ordinary action histories, Hub reports, audio signal report, screenshots and asset sheets.\n- No physical controllers, real touch/iOS hardware, TV, remote humans or listener were available. First-time human 20–30 minute duration remains an unmeasured design target. Original continuous music and exact original timbres are unknown.\n- No runtime CDN, audio files, standalone matchmaking, external publication or persistent server is required.\n\nNo implementation work remains.\n''')\nowned=[]\ncurrent=Path.cwd().resolve()\nfor entry in Path('/proc').iterdir():\n    if not entry.name.isdigit() or int(entry.name) in [os.getpid(),os.getppid()]:\n        continue\n    try:\n        if (entry/'cwd').resolve()\"'!=current:\n            continue\n        args=(entry/'\"'cmdline').read_bytes().replace(b'\\\\0',b' ').decode(errors='replace')\n        if 'tests/browser.py' in args or 'node tools/test.mjs' in args or 'headless_shell' in args or 'chrome-headless-shell' in args:\n            owned.append({'pid':int(entry.name),'command':args[:200]})\n    except (OSError,PermissionError):\n        pass\nPath('evidence/process-cleanup.json').write_t